 "note": "Silent. Part 4. Opener (0-3.2 s) is the ONLY part that differs by hook: ONE strip, two big faces at the counter, both phones lit mid-swipe (generic glow), the jukebox lit behind them, the coin in his hand. Hook b shows the catch in 0-2 s (her eyes to his lit screen 0.4, '!' 0.6, he flips the phone face down 0.65-0.9), then the jukebox flares 1.6 and he lifts the coin. Napkin 'pick a song.' 3.2-5.0. Take 1 (B, 5.0-10.2): coin in the jukebox, kazoo/tuba polka, neon flicker, waitress stare, coffee jumps onto his jacket, she covers her face. Slice wipe counter-clockwise 10.2 'rewind. take 2.'. Take 2 (A, 11.6-18.5): slow ballad, stools turn to face each other, sway, her chin on her hand, napkins 'ok. good pick.' / 'FIRST GOOD CALL / ALL YEAR.'; quiet beat. Phone gag 20.0-22.6: both phones buzz face-up (glow, rattle), she calmly drops an upside-down mug on hers, glow dies, then he does his. Cliff 22.6: waitress slaps the check '1 PIE · 2 FORKS', both reach; vote 26.4; end card 32.0-35.0 (3 s). Clock 11:56 -> 11:59. No NoSwipe, no link on screen.",
